Complete Enterprise Dashboard Enhancement

Objective:

Transform the existing QGuard Helix Dashboard into a world-class Enterprise Quantum Security Command Center™ with executive-grade UX/UI, intelligent information hierarchy, real-time telemetry, AI-powered insights, and premium animations while preserving all existing functionality.

This is a complete redesign of the dashboard experience—not merely a visual refresh.

Overall Design Philosophy

The dashboard should answer three questions within the first five seconds after loading:

What is my organization's current quantum security posture?
What requires immediate attention?
What actions should be prioritized next?

Every element should support rapid decision-making.

The interface should feel premium, modern, clean, data-driven, and enterprise-focused.

