Design Principles

Use a dark enterprise theme with subtle gradients.

Reduce visual clutter.

Increase spacing.

Improve typography hierarchy.

Prefer fewer larger widgets over many tiny cards.

Every widget must have a clear purpose.

Information density should be high without becoming overwhelming.

Animations must be subtle and meaningful.

Everything should feel alive through real-time telemetry.

