Success Criteria

The finished dashboard should feel like a premium enterprise product that can confidently compete with the world's leading cybersecurity platforms.

It should immediately communicate trust, intelligence, operational awareness, and technical excellence while showcasing QGuard Helix's unique differentiators in post-quantum cryptography, AI-assisted remediation, cryptographic asset intelligence, and quantum migration orchestration.

The implementation must preserve all existing backend functionality, APIs, SSE/WebSocket streams, authentication, RBAC, telemetry, and data models while modernizing the frontend architecture into a scalable, production-ready, enterprise-grade command center suitable for organizations ranging from small businesses to Fortune 500 enterprises.